            (lsAugmentedEq20_7LeftMajorant A (lsAplusOfGramNonsingInv A)
              (lsComponentwiseDataMajorant E f y))) +
          νr (realVecToComplex
            (lsAugmentedEq20_7RightMajorant (lsAplusOfGramNonsingInv A)
